# A reload keeps a second pane zoomed into its project and shows the new block there.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
END
keys G <C-w> v
outside <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
	- Call Bob
END
status Reloaded (changed on disk)
see │  󰋜 › Work › Report
see   Work:
see     - Call Bob
